Lark Crowe is a tengu with glossy black feathers and an intense scar cracking his beak vertically in half. He wears leather vests and rugged denim common with old scouts from Austrene.

Lark Crowe is a member of [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]].

The [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall]]'s research records list Lark Crowe among their project leads, alongside [[People/Camden Levine|Camden Levine]], [[People/Alastair Moss|Alastair Moss]] and [[People/Damien Reese|Damien Reese]].
